# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: UnionKingdom | Scene: UnionKingdom6

translate fr strings:

    old "A knife to my throat, I was all but done, my Lady."
    new "Un couteau à ma gorge, j'étais presque fini, ma Dame."

    old "A kiss?"
    new "Un baiser ?"

    old "A brief moment later, he came back out."
    new "Un bref instant plus tard, il revint."

    old "A great path lead up to the dais, where atop the stairs sat the throne of Normandi."
    new "Un grand chemin menait au dais, où trônait, en haut des marches, le siège de Normandi."

    old "A miniscule smile crept along Queen Maeiv's face."
    new "Un sourire minuscule se glissa sur le visage de la reine Maeiv."
